<title>USA: Huaneng Power rates up 8.7 pct this year.</title>
<headline>Huaneng Power rates up 8.7 pct this year.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Huaneng Power International Inc said its 1997 weighted average power rate, based on the planned output, increased about 8.2 percent compared with that of 1996.</p>
<p>The company said it has gained approvals from relevant government agencies for 1997 power rates for all six of its power plants. ((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.))</p>
